Time and Space Complexity

Operation	                        Time Complexity
Access by index ----------------------- O(1)
Traverse (loop) ----------------------- O(n)
Search (unsorted) --------------------- O(n)
Insert at end (push) ------------------ O(1) amortized
Insert at start/middle ---------------- O(n)
Delete at end (pop) ------------------- O(1)
Delete at start/middle ---------------- O(n)